flowchart LR
    subgraph P[Operational EduPulse Platform - IMPLEMENTED]
        R[Interactive Reader]
        T[Telemetry and micro-interactions]
        N[Notes, annotations, Ask AI, feedback]
        H[Heuristic confusion score and heatmap]
        D[(Operational PostgreSQL)]
        R --> T
        R --> N
        T --> H
        N --> H
        T --> D
        N --> D
        H --> D
    end

    subgraph G[Research Governance Gate - PROPOSED]
        C[Consent and participant notice]
        E[Ethics or institutional approval]
        V[Schema version and provenance validation]
        X[De-identification and retention policy]
        C --> E --> V --> X
    end

    subgraph L[Ground-Truth Layers - PROPOSED]
        S[Momentary self-report]
        TL[Teacher region or page label]
        Q[Quiz item outcome]
        EX[Exam or delayed outcome]
    end

    subgraph M[Paper 1 Modeling Pipeline - PROPOSED]
        F[Event, text, spatial, temporal, and content features]
        SP[Student-page sequence encoder]
        CA[Cohort and spatial aggregator]
        MT[Multi-task prediction heads]
        CAL[Post-hoc calibration and uncertainty]
        O[Evidence-aware cohort output]
        F --> SP --> CA --> MT --> CAL --> O
    end

    subgraph EV[Evaluation - PROPOSED]
        B[Heuristic and ML baselines]
        A[Ablations]
        CV[Grouped temporal and course splits]
        MET[Discrimination, calibration, localization, lead time]
        ST[Cluster-aware statistics and subgroup audit]
        B --> MET
        A --> MET
        CV --> MET --> ST
    end

    D -. only approved records .-> G
    X --> F
    S --> MT
    TL --> MT
    Q --> MT
    EX --> MT
    O --> EV

    subgraph PI[Pedagogical Intervention Program - FUTURE]
        IA[Instructor action]
        OUT[Subsequent learning outcome]
        CS[Causal or stepped-wedge study]
        IA --> OUT --> CS
    end

    O -. future decision support .-> IA
